#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:5 6946631263854020af2567e4f899097d
msgid "Modes"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:7 790d016d997247f8bdc3d68ea9873cae
msgid ""
"This outlines the differences in sailboat behavior from the standard Rover "
":ref:`modes <rover-control-modes>`."
msgstr "本页概述帆船行为与标准 Rover :ref:`模式 <rover-control-modes>` 的区别。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:10 aa54312c75b54487a56a0c25c8c65a03
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Manual"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:11 cd80514e8ff84e0993475916074f9a38
msgid ""
"Sail position is directly controlled by throttle position. Minimum throttle "
"is sail fully in, maximum throttle is sail fully released. You may find the "
"controller disarms when tacking to the left travelling upwind with the sails"
" tight. If this is an issue disable :ref:`stick disarming <ARMING_RUDDER>`."
msgstr ""
"帆位直接由油门位置控制。最小油门时帆完全收起，最大油门时帆完全放开。在顶风左舷换舷时帆收紧，控制器可能会解锁。若出现此问题，请禁用 :ref:`摇杆解锁"
" <ARMING_RUDDER>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:16 d99b03829ff7442fad4218755369eac7
msgid "ACRO"
msgstr "ACRO"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:17 2c07912bca5b4059a6aaacb2cb595a95
msgid ""
"The Sail is automatically trimmed to the wind direction using the wind vane."
" A tack can be triggered from an aux switch; the vehicle will match its "
"current angle to the true wind on the new tack. Note that the vehicle will "
"only try to sail if the operator is requesting some forward speed with the "
"throttle input. With 0 throttle input the vehicle will let out its sail in a"
" attempt to stop."
msgstr ""
"帆通过风速传感器自动调整为风向。可通过辅助开关触发换舷；车辆将在新换舷上保持与真风相同的当前角度。注意只有操作员通过油门输入请求一定前进速度时，车辆才会尝试使用帆驾驶。油门输入为"
" 0 时，车辆将放帆以尝试停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:23 630fc57efdad48e982ce52134975be93
msgid "Loiter"
msgstr "Loiter"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:27 e3508861a21b4cce973e6b494d520809
msgid ""
"The vehicle will keep moving within the :ref:`loiter radius <LOIT_RADIUS>`."
msgstr "车辆将在 :ref:`Loiter 半径 <LOIT_RADIUS>` 内持续移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:31 91e20b8674054cd0a83f638b4193df2d
msgid "RTL"
msgstr "RTL"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:32 b6d6a858832a4ce1b219b0eed143fde0
msgid "The vehicle will tack upwind back to the home location if required."
msgstr "车辆将在必要时逆风抢风换舷返回归航位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:35 29c1898e346a4e8c993ecb02db10a3a3
msgid "AUTO"
msgstr "AUTO"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-modes.rst:39 55670a320171443691c40593cd832665
msgid ""
"The vehicle will tack upwind to reach the next waypoint if required. Note "
"that if the vehicle has to tack it will not stay on the line between "
"waypoints. While traveling upwind a tack can be triggered from an aux switch"
" or by a maximum cross track error defined by ``WP_OVERSHOOT "
"<WP_OVERSHOOT>``."
msgstr ""
"车辆将在必要时逆风抢风换舷以到达下一航点。注意若车辆需要换舷，将不会保持在两个航点之间的航线上。逆风行驶时，可通过辅助开关或由 "
"``WP_OVERSHOOT <WP_OVERSHOOT>`` 定义的最大横向偏差触发换舷。"
